-- args
format --stdin-file-path input.md --wrap 200
-- stdin
ASCII possessive: `x`'s value.

Curly possessive: `x`’s value.

Plural possessive: `users`' value.

Non-possessive suffix: `x`'t value.

Bare unmatched quote: `x`' value.

Unmatched opening quote: '`x` value.

ASCII quoted code: '`x`' value.

Curly quoted code: ‘`x`’ value.

Detached quotes: before ' `x` ' after.

Hyphenated suffix: `x`-like value.

Emphasis possessive: *x*'s value.

Link possessive: [x](https://example.com)'s value.

Math possessive: $x$'s value.

Adjacent code spans: (`a`,`b`).
-- stdout
ASCII possessive: `x`'s value.

Curly possessive: `x`’s value.

Plural possessive: `users`' value.

Non-possessive suffix: `x`'t value.

Bare unmatched quote: `x`' value.

Unmatched opening quote: '`x` value.

ASCII quoted code: '`x`' value.

Curly quoted code: ‘`x`’ value.

Detached quotes: before ' `x` ' after.

Hyphenated suffix: `x`-like value.

Emphasis possessive: *x*'s value.

Link possessive: [x](https://example.com)'s value.

Math possessive: $x$'s value.

Adjacent code spans: (`a`,`b`).
-- stderr
-- status
0
